{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WRAITH OPS\u00a0</strong>is a <strong>fast-paced tactical FPS</strong> built for satisfying gunplay and team-based objective combat. With snappy movement, precise shooting, and immersive tactical mechanics, it delivers a refined, back-to-basics experience. Designed to challenge and empower players, every feature enhances the action and never slows it down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/950660/extras/8c7a4f2cacda936c54bd3ef12369af6f.avif?t=1762256256\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/950660/extras_big/8c7a4f2cacda936c54bd3ef12369af6f.avif?t=1762256256 width=800 height=370 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/950660/extras/9610c3815cdb7ae1423ca118aa1f9b1a.avif?t=1762256256\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/950660/extras_big/9610c3815cdb7ae1423ca118aa1f9b1a.avif?t=1762256256 width=800 height=64 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Overlord 8v8</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gun Game</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arena Mode</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Team Death Match</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/950660/extras/a8dd0b2d42a139ce4a8ec311a91b1092.avif?t=1762256256\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/950660/extras_big/a8dd0b2d42a139ce4a8ec311a91b1092.avif?t=1762256256 width=800 height=240 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WRAITH OPS</strong> will offer an arsenal of more than 38<strong>\u00a0weapons</strong>\u00a0of various firepower, types and sizes on release! On release, you will be able to adjust and customize your weapons with various attachments (sights. muzzle devices, gadgets, camos, perks) that affect weapon handling and other stats.<br>  <br>When creating your loadout, you will be able to craft your perfect operator preset from the following options:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Primary, Secondary &amp; Melee weapons</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Throwables (Offensive, Defensive &amp; Tactical)</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stimulants</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clothing, Gear, Camouflage &amp; Patches</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Class-specific Ability &amp; Weapon Perk</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Special Gestures, Nightvision &amp; Tablet</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/950660/extras/0ce3e5d4fe6f96bb9fc515be2c6db027.avif?t=1762256256\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/950660/extras_big/0ce3e5d4fe6f96bb9fc515be2c6db027.avif?t=1762256256 width=800 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>WRAITH OPS</strong>, there are two competing factions. Aegis Industries and Volga Battalion. Both Private Military Companies are tasked with achieving the same goal, investigating and retrieving remnants of a Cold War research project codenamed \u201cProject Wraith\u201d. Intel about their goal is scarce, but hints gathered by either side will take you to various places around the world. We aim to let you fight in as many locations as possible, but some locations may come later after release.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Complex</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Airbase</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steelworks</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Submarine</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mall</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arena</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WRAITH OPS</strong> utilizes a\u00a0<strong>dynamic weather system</strong>, allowing for runtime or config-based weather changes across all of our maps. Weather changes can be gradual or instant, allowing for a change of ambience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/950660/extras/39d0a869b36fb7db24977721a2bcab37.avif?t=1762256256\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/950660/extras_big/39d0a869b36fb7db24977721a2bcab37.avif?t=1762256256 width=800 height=64 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arsenal</strong>\u00a0- Large variety of exotic weapons and attachments to choose from.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customization</strong>\u00a0- Variety of gear, clothing and camo to build your perfect Operator.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ballistics and Penetration System </strong>- Fast TTK but with impactful aim. Headshots are rewarded.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Visual Fidelity</strong>\u00a0- Gritty, atmospheric and as authentic as possible with great animations to make you feel immersed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Community</strong>\u00a0- Strong community focus. Our active presence shows our dedication to making a long-lasting game, not yearly abandonware.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Level</strong> <strong>Design</strong>\u00a0- Immersive, well-thought-out maps with no unnecessary chokepoints, focus on fast-paced objective-oriented PVP experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Damage</strong> <strong>Model</strong>\u00a0- Realistic damage model.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Audio</strong>- Immersive, easy-to-pinpoint sound design. Satisfying gun sounds, loud and clear footsteps, focus on the sounds that matter.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game</strong> <strong>Modes</strong>\u00a0- Variety of game modes on launch, ability to host custom servers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No</strong> <strong>Loot</strong> <strong>Boxes</strong>\u00a0- Zero pay-to-win or aggressive, anti-player monetisation.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/950660?t=1762256256","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/950660/47eca200251ed27ee3bdd5d396e731b17a19dce7/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762256256","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/950660/bbe2f5c6664d2b42166e569616c0ab405d21f87b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762256256","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/950660/bbe2f5c6664d2b42166e569616c0ab405d21f87b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762256256","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Frequent and heavy blood, gore and violence."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WRAITH OPS\u00a0</strong>is a <strong>fast-paced tactical FPS</strong> built for satisfying gunplay and team-based objective combat. With snappy movement, precise shooting, and immersive tactical mechanics, it delivers a refined, back-to-basics experience. Designed to challenge and empower players, every feature enhances the action and never slows it down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/950660/extras/8c7a4f2cacda936c54bd3ef12369af6f.avif?t=1762256256\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/950660/extras_big/8c7a4f2cacda936c54bd3ef12369af6f.avif?t=1762256256 width=800 height=370 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/950660/extras/9610c3815cdb7ae1423ca118aa1f9b1a.avif?t=1762256256\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/950660/extras_big/9610c3815cdb7ae1423ca118aa1f9b1a.avif?t=1762256256 width=800 height=64 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Overlord 8v8</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gun Game</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arena Mode</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Team Death Match</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/950660/extras/a8dd0b2d42a139ce4a8ec311a91b1092.avif?t=1762256256\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/950660/extras_big/a8dd0b2d42a139ce4a8ec311a91b1092.avif?t=1762256256 width=800 height=240 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WRAITH OPS</strong> will offer an arsenal of more than 38<strong>\u00a0weapons</strong>\u00a0of various firepower, types and sizes on release! On release, you will be able to adjust and customize your weapons with various attachments (sights. muzzle devices, gadgets, camos, perks) that affect weapon handling and other stats.<br>  <br>When creating your loadout, you will be able to craft your perfect operator preset from the following options:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Primary, Secondary &amp; Melee weapons</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Throwables (Offensive, Defensive &amp; Tactical)</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stimulants</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clothing, Gear, Camouflage &amp; Patches</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Class-specific Ability &amp; Weapon Perk</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Special Gestures, Nightvision &amp; Tablet</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/950660/extras/0ce3e5d4fe6f96bb9fc515be2c6db027.avif?t=1762256256\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/950660/extras_big/0ce3e5d4fe6f96bb9fc515be2c6db027.avif?t=1762256256 width=800 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>WRAITH OPS</strong>, there are two competing factions. Aegis Industries and Volga Battalion. Both Private Military Companies are tasked with achieving the same goal, investigating and retrieving remnants of a Cold War research project codenamed \u201cProject Wraith\u201d. Intel about their goal is scarce, but hints gathered by either side will take you to various places around the world. We aim to let you fight in as many locations as possible, but some locations may come later after release.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Complex</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Airbase</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steelworks</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Submarine</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mall</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arena</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WRAITH OPS</strong> utilizes a\u00a0<strong>dynamic weather system</strong>, allowing for runtime or config-based weather changes across all of our maps. Weather changes can be gradual or instant, allowing for a change of ambience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/950660/extras/39d0a869b36fb7db24977721a2bcab37.avif?t=1762256256\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/950660/extras_big/39d0a869b36fb7db24977721a2bcab37.avif?t=1762256256 width=800 height=64 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arsenal</strong>\u00a0- Large variety of exotic weapons and attachments to choose from.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customization</strong>\u00a0- Variety of gear, clothing and camo to build your perfect Operator.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ballistics and Penetration System </strong>- Fast TTK but with impactful aim. Headshots are rewarded.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Visual Fidelity</strong>\u00a0- Gritty, atmospheric and as authentic as possible with great animations to make you feel immersed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Community</strong>\u00a0- Strong community focus. Our active presence shows our dedication to making a long-lasting game, not yearly abandonware.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Level</strong> <strong>Design</strong>\u00a0- Immersive, well-thought-out maps with no unnecessary chokepoints, focus on fast-paced objective-oriented PVP experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Damage</strong> <strong>Model</strong>\u00a0- Realistic damage model.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Audio</strong>- Immersive, easy-to-pinpoint sound design. Satisfying gun sounds, loud and clear footsteps, focus on the sounds that matter.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game</strong> <strong>Modes</strong>\u00a0- Variety of game modes on launch, ability to host custom servers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No</strong> <strong>Loot</strong> <strong>Boxes</strong>\u00a0- Zero pay-to-win or aggressive, anti-player monetisation.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Grassrootz Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/950660/45105316943c4c422704f77e7d9ad7dc9a929fb1/header.jpg?t=1762256256","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"WRAITH OPS and its associated content is managed and owned by Grassrootz Studio, based in the United Kingdom. Published under licence by Team17 Digital Limited. Team17 is a trademark or registered trademark of Team17 Digital Limited. All other trademarks, copyrights and logos are property of their respective owners.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/950660/1270124655/b00e95e794395ada733cd6bdab3a7295450a9c0a/1762250722/dash_av1.mpd?t=1762256253","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/950660/1270124655/b00e95e794395ada733cd6bdab3a7295450a9c0a/1762250722/dash_h264.mpd?t=1762256253","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/950660/1270124655/b00e95e794395ada733cd6bdab3a7295450a9c0a/1762250722/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1762256253","id":257185367,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257185367/movie480.mp4?t=1762256253","max":"https